  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "The corner lot on Maple Street had been empty for years — just cracked concrete, weeds, and broken glass.",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "durationSeconds": 7.325
    },
    {
      "text": "Every time Daniela walked past it, she felt a pang of frustration.",
      "startSeconds": 7.625,
      "durationSeconds": 4.825
    },
    {
      "text": "Her neighborhood deserved better.",
      "startSeconds": 12.75,
      "durationSeconds": 2.35
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Why does nobody care about this place?\" she asked her grandmother.",
      "startSeconds": 15.4,
      "durationSeconds": 4.175
    },
    {
      "text": "Her grandmother smiled and told her about community gardens in Detroit, where neighbors turned hundreds of empty lots into farms that now feed thousands of people.",
      "startSeconds": 20.275,
      "durationSeconds": 10.425
    },
    {
      "text": "\"They started with nothing too,\" she said.",
      "startSeconds": 31,
      "durationSeconds": 2.9
    },
    {
      "text": "\"But they believed something beautiful could grow there.\"",
      "startSeconds": 34.2,
      "durationSeconds": 3.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Daniela started small.",
      "startSeconds": 38,
      "durationSeconds": 2.2
    },
    {
      "text": "She researched what vegetables grow well in their climate.",
      "startSeconds": 40.5,
      "durationSeconds": 3.625
    },
    {
      "text": "She drafted a proposal for the city with a budget, a timeline, and a maintenance plan.",
      "startSeconds": 44.425,
      "durationSeconds": 5.925
    },
    {
      "text": "She recruited five neighbors to form a garden committee, each responsible for a different section.",
      "startSeconds": 50.65,
      "durationSeconds": 6.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Three months later, the lot had raised beds, a rain barrel system, and a hand-painted sign that read \"Maple Street Community Garden.\" The first harvest produced enough tomatoes, peppers, and herbs for twenty families.",
      "startSeconds": 57.65,
      "durationSeconds": 14.375
    },
    {
      "text": "Neighbors who had never spoken to each other were now sharing recipes over the fence.",
      "startSeconds": 72.325,
      "durationSeconds": 5.35
    }
  ],
